OL,3,GNEWSAKiller to stay in prison after
OL,4,Aparole bid rejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who killed a woman and buried her
OL,7,Fremains at a North Yorkshire beauty
OL,8,Fspot has had his bid for release from
OL,9,Fprison rejected.
OL,11,FMartin Bell attacked 23-year-old Gemma
OL,12,FSimpson with a hammer and stabbed her
OL,13,Fat his flat in Harrogate in May 2000.
OL,14,FHe then dismembered her body and buried
OL,15,Fher at Brimham Rocks near Pateley
OL,16,FBridge.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
