OL,3,GNEWSAKiller to stay in prison after
OL,4,Aparole bid rejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FGemma, from Leeds, was treated as a
OL,7,Fmissing person until Bell confessed in
OL,8,F2014. He was sentenced to life
OL,9,Fimprisonment with a minimum term of 11
OL,10,Fyears and 205 days after admitting
OL,11,Fmanslaughter with diminished
OL,12,Fresponsibility.
OL,14,FHis appeal was heard by the Parole
OL,15,FBoard who said it was not satisfied
OL,16,Fthat release at this point would be
OL,17,Fsafe for the protection of the public.
